"homeWinPercentage":0.1045,"playId":"401869964287","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1014,"playId":"401869964290","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1013,"playId":"401869964296","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1077,"playId":"401869964294","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1067,"playId":"401869964298","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0956,"playId":"401869964302","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1007,"playId":"401869964307","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1042,"playId":"401869964310","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1148,"playId":"401869964314","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1171,"playId":"401869964320","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1067,"playId":"401869964324","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1263,"playId":"401869964328","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1355,"playId":"401869964333","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1428,"playId":"401869964337","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1594,"playId":"401869964342","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1576,"playId":"401869964348","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1637,"playId":"401869964346","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.1607,"playId":"401869964353","tiePercentage":0}],"gameInfo":{"venue":{"id":"3815","guid":"b880d64b-a7fd-3c82-9831-ebd4e4e308d7","fullName":"M. M. Roberts Stadium","address":{"city":"Hattiesburg","state":"MS","zipCode":"39406","country":"USA"},"grass":false,"images":[{"href":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/venues/college-football/day/interior/3815.jpg","width":2000,"height":1125,"alt":"","rel":["full","day","interior"]}]},"attendance":24182},"article":{"headline":"JC Evans has 4 total TDs, James Madison beats Southern Miss 54-23","description":"— JC Evans threw a touchdown pass and added three rushing touchdowns, and James Madison beat Southern Miss 54-23 on Thursday night.","story":"HATTIESBURG, Miss. -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5172036/jc-evans\" target=\"_new\">JC Evans</a> threw a touchdown pass and added three rushing touchdowns, and James Madison beat Southern Miss 54-23 on Thursday night. \n\n\r\n              Evans made his first start since he suffered an injury in JMU's season-opening <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/liberty-james-madison-football-score-12693af52415efbf1e891dae7dce3196\">20-13</a> win over Liberty and was 19-of-26 passing for 251 yards. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5153978/camden-coleman\" target=\"_new\">Camden Coleman</a>, who had started the last eight games for the Dukes, entered in the fourth quarter and threw a 26-yard touchdown pass to <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5214955/michael-scott\" target=\"_new\">Michael Scott</a>. \n\n\r\n              James Madison (8-2, 5-2 Sun Belt Conference) had lost consecutive games for the first time since back-to-back <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/james-madison-appalachian-state-score-a160b4f3a03eb7e112c5d83bf9d050c1\">defeats at Appalachian State</a> and in <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/marshall-james-madison-score-b114bfd72c135d98b65b938520ac8a9f\">double overtime against Marshall</a> to conclude the 2024 regular season. \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079628/john-white\" target=\"_new\">John White</a> was 17-of-28 passing for 150 yards and a touchdown and had a 3-yard rushing touchdown for Southern Miss (3-6, 2-3). <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4685510/kaden-saunders\" target=\"_new\">Kaden Saunders</a> had six receptions for 122 yards. \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5394596/steven-robinson\" target=\"_new\">Steven Robinson</a>'s 2-yard TD run gave the Golden Eagles their first lead with 37 seconds left in the second quarter, but <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4691984/morgan-suarez\" target=\"_new\">Morgan Suarez</a> kicked his third and final field goal, a 40-yarder, as time expired to make it 16-14 at halftime. \n\n\r\n              Evans scored rushing touchdowns of 16 and 2 yards in the third quarter before he threw a 16-yard TD pass to <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5225435/seth-cromwell\" target=\"_new\">Seth Cromwell</a> that gave the Dukes a 37-14 lead with 13:41 to play. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5257958/jackson-mccarter\" target=\"_new\">Jackson McCarter</a> added 30-yard rushing TD a little more than 2 minutes later. \n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next </hl2>\r\n              James Madison: Visits UConn on Nov. 14. \n\n\r\n              Southern Miss: Plays Nov. 14 at Louisiana Tech. \n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"https://apnews.com/newsletters\">Sign up for Top 25 poll alerts here</a>, visit <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/ap-top-25-college-football-poll\">the Top 25 here</a> and see AP’s full <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/college-football\">college football coverage here</a>","published":"2026-11-06T05:04:34Z"}}